# Security-critical: this deployment carries NO Gemini key of its own by
# design (see server.py's module docstring) — argus/.env must never reach
# the image. Written explicitly with ** rather than relying on Docker's
# ignore-pattern matcher behaving identically to .gitignore's.
# The stronger guarantee this actually rests on: argus/.env has never
# been committed to git (confirmed via `git log --all -- **/.env`), and
# this deploy builds from the pushed GitHub repo, not local disk — so
# even if a .dockerignore pattern here were subtly wrong, there is no
# copy of .env in the build context for it to fail to exclude.
**/.env
.env

.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Local ADK session/artifact state — never ship a visitor's own prior
# session history baked into the image.
*.db
*.sqlite3
.adk/
**/.adk/

.ablation_checkpoint.json

.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local-only planning docs (git-ignored already; excluded here too so a
# `docker build` from an unclean working tree can't leak them either).
.claude/
ARGUS_ADK_Requirements.md
PLAN.md
CLAUDE.md
INTERVIEW.md
